MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Native school browser (electron/school-view.ts): agent's browser tabs are
  real WebContentsViews composited over the chat right rail — no screencast,
  pixel-perfect at native retina, direct input. App opens remote-debugging
  port 9333 itself (config.yaml browser.cdp_url unchanged); legacy headless
  Chrome path kept behind userData/school-browser.json {"mode":"mirror"}.
- Electron CDP gaps handled: Target.createTarget unsupported → tabs created
  app-side via window.open + setWindowOpenHandler; browser_tool.py steers
  off the file:// app-shell target, creates/re-finds per-origin tabs by URL
  match (@native sentinel), 6 new tests (32 total green).
- App-shell protection: will-navigate guard + did-navigate history recovery;
  proven live — agent-ordered navigation of the app window is a no-op.
- CRITICAL FIX: defer home-tab attach until window 'show' — attaching a
  WebContentsView to the hidden pre-first-paint window wedged compositing
  (window never painted, rAF dead).
- Bounds glue: renderer reports panel rect (ResizeObserver + 250ms poll +
  zoom re-send); main scales by zoomFactor — view tracks panel at any zoom.
- Library right rail (note-rail.tsx): collapse toggle (persisted), Outline
  tab from h1–h3 headings (click scrolls editor), Links tab with outgoing
  wikilinks/md-links + backlinks; hides gracefully under lg breakpoint.
- Recorder archive (archive.tsx): saved recordings master-detail — audio
  playback via hermes-media:// streaming (16MB IPC cap avoided), AI notes,
  raw transcript, enhance/flashcards actions.
- Stale compiled .js twins refreshed by build; deleted-then-regenerated for
  library (dev-server staleness fix).
- Zoom audit passed 69–144% across chat/library/study/recorder.
